  "term": "genito-pelvic pain/penetration disorder",
  "definition": "Genito-pelvic pain/penetration disorder is a sexual dysfunction involving pain during intercourse or problems related to penetration. In this diagnostic context, it refers to a persistent sexual problem that lasts at least 6 months and causes clinically significant distress.",
